dp(i,j) = min cost to combine all the slimes (i,j) int one
base case: 
dp(i,i) = 0
dp(i,j) = sum(i,j) + dp(i,k) + dp(k+1,j) where k = i to j-1
*/
#include <bits/stdc++.h>
